      "why_it_matters": "The mask contract is not documented and does not match what the interface suggests. A two-dimensional additive mask is accepted and then ignored, so a submission that broadcasts its bias to the wrong rank returns a correctly shaped, correctly typed, wrong tensor. Any entry whose core carries a pre-softmax additive term depends on this, and it cannot be read off the interface; it has to be probed."
